"\n  <header class=\"topbar\">\n    <a class=\"brand\" href=\"/\" aria-label=\"漫游旅行票夹首页\">\n      <span class=\"brand-mark\"><i data-lucide=\"route\"></i></span>\n      <span><b>漫游</b><small>ROAM · TRAVEL WALLET</small></span>\n    </a>\n    <div class=\"top-actions\">\n      <span class=\"access-badge\" id=\"accessBadge\">演示版 · 只读</span>\n      <span class=\"save-state\" id=\"saveState\" hidden></span>\n      <button class=\"text-button\" id=\"styleButton\" type=\"button\"><i data-lucide=\"palette\"></i><span>航空票夹</span></button>\n      <details class=\"more-menu\" id=\"moreMenu\">\n        <summary class=\"icon-button\" aria-label=\"更多操作\"><i data-lucide=\"ellipsis\"></i></summary>\n        <div class=\"more-menu-panel\">\n          <button id=\"tripButton\" type=\"button\" data-open-editor=\"trip\" hidden>旅程</button>\n          <button id=\"agentButton\" type=\"button\" data-open-section=\"agent\" hidden>Agent 更新</button>\n          <button id=\"exportButton\" type=\"button\" hidden>导出</button>\n          <button id=\"manifestButton\" type=\"button\" hidden>附件</button>\n          <button id=\"linksButton\" type=\"button\" hidden>分享</button>\n          <button id=\"dataButton\" type=\"button\" hidden>数据</button>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n      <button class=\"icon-button\" id=\"themeButton\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"切换明暗模式\">\n        <i data-lucide=\"moon\"></i>\n      </button>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <section class=\"trip-header\" id=\"tripHeader\" hidden>\n    <div class=\"trip-header-inner\">\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\">BOARDING WALLET · YOUR JOURNEY</p>\n      <div class=\"trip-title-row\">\n        <div>\n          <h1 id=\"tripTitle\"></h1>\n          <p id=\"tripMeta\"></p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"trip-stamp\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>ROUTE</span><b id=\"tripCode\">PEK</b></div>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"trip-note\" id=\"tripNote\"></p>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <nav class=\"module-nav\" id=\"moduleNav\" aria-label=\"旅行模块\" hidden>\n    <button data-tab=\"travel\" class=\"active\"><i data-lucide=\"tickets-plane\"></i><span>出行</span></button>\n    <button data-tab=\"itinerary\"><i data-lucide=\"route\"></i><span>行程</span></button>\n    <button data-tab=\"prepare\"><i data-lucide=\"list-checks\"></i><span>准备</span></button>\n    <button data-tab=\"expenses\"><i data-lucide=\"wallet-cards\"></i><span>记账</span></button>\n    <button data-tab=\"materials\"><i data-lucide=\"folder-open\"></i><span>资料</span></button>\n  </nav>\n\n  <main id=\"app\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n    <section class=\"state-view\" id=\"loadingView\">\n      <span class=\"loading-mark\"></span>\n      <h1>正在打开旅行票夹</h1>\n      <p>读取行程、票据和准备事项…</p>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n\n  <div class=\"toast\" id=\"toast\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>\n\n  <div id=\"confirmDialog\" class=\"confirm-overlay\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"confirmDialogTitle\" hidden>\n    <div class=\"confirm-box\">\n      <div class=\"dialog-head\">\n        <div><span class=\"section-kicker\">CONFIRM</span><h2 id=\"confirmDialogTitle\">确认操作</h2></div>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"dialog-note\" id=\"confirmDialogMessage\"></p>\n      <footer class=\"dialog-footer\">\n        <button class=\"text-button\" id=\"confirmCancel\" type=\"button\">取消</button>\n        <button class=\"text-button primary-action\" id=\"confirmOk\" type=\"button\">确定</button>\n      </footer>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <dialog id=\"dataDialog\" aria-labelledby=\"dataDialogTitle\">\n    <div class=\"dialog-head\">\n      <div><span class=\"section-kicker\">TRAVELPACK 1.1</span><h2 id=\"dataDialogTitle\">导入与编辑数据</h2></div>\n      <button class=\"icon-button\" id=\"dialogClose\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"关闭\">×</button>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"dialog-note\">可粘贴 Agent 生成的 TravelPack，或选择 JSON 文件。保存会整份更新旅行数据。</p>\n    <div class=\"dialog-actions\">\n      <label class=\"file-button\">选择 JSON 文件<input id=\"importFile\" type=\"file\" accept=\"application/json,.json\"></label>\n      <button class=\"text-button\" id=\"formatButton\" type=\"button\">格式化</button>\n    </div>\n    <textarea id=\"jsonEditor\" spellcheck=\"false\" aria-label=\"TravelPack JSON\"></textarea>\n    <p class=\"dialog-error\" id=\"dialogError\" role=\"alert\"></p>\n    <footer class=\"dialog-footer\">\n      <button class=\"text-button\" id=\"dialogCancel\" type=\"button\">取消</button>\n      <button class=\"text-button primary-action\" id=\"saveButton\" type=\"button\">保存到云端</button>\n    </footer>\n  </dialog>\n\n  <dialog id=\"attachmentDialog\" aria-labelledby=\"attachmentDialogTitle\">\n    <div class=\"dialog-head\">\n      <div><span class=\"section-kicker\">ATTACHMENTS</span><h2 id=\"attachmentDialogTitle\">上传附件</h2></div>\n      <button class=\"icon-button\" id=\"attachmentDialogClose\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"关闭\">×</button>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"dialog-note\">从相册选照片或上传 PDF，单个文件不超过 5MB，手机原图会自动压缩。附件会关联到已有资料条目，只有你登录后能查看。</p>\n    <div class=\"attachment-form\">\n      <label>关联资料<select id=\"attachmentMaterial\"></select></label>\n      <label>选择文件<input id=\"attachmentFile\" type=\"file\" accept=\"image/*,application/pdf\"></label>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"dialog-error\" id=\"attachmentError\" role=\"alert\"></p>\n    <footer class=\"dialog-footer\">\n      <button class=\"text-button\" id=\"attachmentCancel\" type=\"button\">取消</button>\n      <button class=\"text-button primary-action\" id=\"uploadAttachmentButton\" type=\"button\">上传并保存</button>\n    </footer>\n  </dialog>\n\n  <dialog id=\"maintenanceDialog\" class=\"maintenance-dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"maintenanceDialogTitle\">\n    <div class=\"dialog-head\">\n      <div><span class=\"section-kicker\">EDIT</span><h2 id=\"maintenanceDialogTitle\">编辑</h2></div>\n      <button class=\"icon-button\" id=\"maintenanceClose\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"关闭\">×</button>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"maintenance-body\" id=\"maintenanceBody\"></div>\n    <p class=\"dialog-error\" id=\"maintenanceError\" role=\"alert\"></p>\n    <footer class=\"dialog-footer\">\n      <button class=\"text-button\" id=\"maintenanceCancel\" type=\"button\">关闭</button>\n    </footer>\n  </dialog>\n\n  <dialog id=\"linksDialog\" aria-labelledby=\"linksDialogTitle\">\n    <div class=\"dialog-head\">\n      <div><span class=\"section-kicker\">ACCESS LINKS</span><h2 id=\"linksDialogTitle\">管理访问链接</h2></div>\n      <button class=\"icon-button\" id=\"linksDialogClose\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"关闭\">×</button>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"dialog-note\">重新生成会让现有编辑链接和只读链接立即失效。新链接只显示在本次操作结果中，请分别保存。</p>\n    <div class=\"link-results\" id=\"linkResults\" hidden>\n      <label>新编辑链接<textarea id=\"newEditLink\" readonly></textarea></label>\n      <button class=\"text-button\" type=\"button\" data-copy-link=\"newEditLink\">复制编辑链接</button>\n      <label>新只读链接<textarea id=\"newReadLink\" readonly></textarea></label>\n      <button class=\"text-button\" type=\"button\" data-copy-link=\"newReadLink\">复制只读链接</button>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"dialog-error\" id=\"linksError\" role=\"alert\"></p>\n    <footer class=\"dialog-footer\">\n      <button class=\"text-button\" id=\"linksCancel\" type=\"button\">关闭</button>\n      <button class=\"text-button primary-action\" id=\"rotateLinksButton\" type=\"button\">重新生成两条链接</button>\n    </footer>\n  </dialog>\n\n  <dialog id=\"placeDialog\" class=\"place-dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"placeDialogTitle\">\n    <div class=\"dialog-head\">\n      <div><span class=\"section-kicker\" id=\"placeDialogKicker\">PLACE</span><h2 id=\"placeDialogTitle\">地点详情</h2></div>\n      <button class=\"icon-button\" id=\"placeDialogClose\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"关闭\">×</button>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"dialog-body\" id=\"placeDialogBody\"></div>\n    <footer class=\"dialog-footer\">\n      <button class=\"text-button primary-action\" id=\"placeDialogDone\" type=\"button\">知道了</button>\n    </footer>\n  </dialog>\n\n  <dialog id=\"styleDialog\" class=\"style-dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"styleDialogTitle\">\n    <div class=\"dialog-head\">\n      <div><span class=\"section-kicker\">APPEARANCE</span><h2 id=\"styleDialogTitle\">选择旅行界面风格</h2></div>\n      <button class=\"icon-button\" id=\"styleDialogClose\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"关闭\">×</button>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"dialog-note\">六种风格共用数据与交互。新增三种方向先审核出行模块。</p>\n    <div class=\"style-options\">\n      <button class=\"style-choice\" type=\"button\" data-style-choice=\"aviation\">\n        <span class=\"style-preview style-preview-aviation\"><b>漫游</b><strong>BOARDING WALLET</strong><i></i><i></i></span>\n        <span><b>航空票夹</b><small>航空蓝 · 票夹与时间轴</small></span>\n      </button>\n      <button class=\"style-choice\" type=\"button\" data-style-choice=\"natural\">\n        <span class=\"style-preview style-preview-natural\"><b>漫游</b><strong>TRAVEL JOURNAL</strong><i></i><i></i></span>\n        <span><b>自然手账</b><small>暖白 · 鼠尾草绿 · 旅行手账</small></span>\n      </button>\n      <button class=\"style-choice\" type=\"button\" data-style-choice=\"minimal\">\n        <span class=\"style-preview style-preview-minimal\"><b>漫游</b><strong>TRIP OVERVIEW</strong><i></i><i></i></span>\n        <span><b>极简导览</b><small>冷白 · 清晰蓝 · 高信息密度</small></span>\n      </button>\n      <button class=\"style-choice\" type=\"button\" data-style-choice=\"collage\">\n        <span class=\"style-preview style-preview-collage\"><b>漫游</b><strong>切开城市 · 拼出路线</strong><i></i><i></i></span>\n        <span><b>拼贴裁纸</b><small>毛边纸片 · 橙蓝撞色 · 旅行剪报</small></span>\n      </button>\n      <button class=\"style-choice\" type=\"button\" data-style-choice=\"print\">\n        <span class=\"style-preview style-preview-print\"><b>漫游日报</b><strong>ROUTE / 01</strong><i></i><i></i></span>\n        <span><b>印刷风</b><small>套色油墨 · 网点肌理 · 编辑版式</small></span>\n      </button>\n      <button class=\"style-choice\" type=\"button\" data-style-choice=\"urban\">\n        <span class=\"styl